---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import siteConfig from '../data/site-config.json';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | 4K Subscription IPTV"
  metaDescription="How 4K Subscription IPTV collects, uses and protects your data when you browse our site, request a free trial or contact support."
  targetKeyword="Privacy Policy"
  slug="privacy-policy"
>
  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="container legal-wrap">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: October 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>{siteConfig.siteName} (4ksubscriptioniptv.com) provides IPTV subscription information and support. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.supportEmail}`}>{siteConfig.supportEmail}</a> or WhatsApp {siteConfig.whatsappDisplay}.</p>

      <h2>2. Data we collect</h2>
      <p>We only receive the information you choose to send us: your name or email when you message us on WhatsApp or by email, the plan you ask about, and the device you use. Our site does not require an account.</p>

      <h2>3. How we use it</h2>
      <p>To reply to your questions, deliver free-trial and subscription credentials, provide setup support, and prevent abuse. We do not sell your personal data.</p>

      <h2>4. Third parties</h2>
      <p>Fonts and icons are served from this site. WhatsApp links open a chat on WhatsApp, which is governed by WhatsApp's own privacy policy.</p>

      <h2>5. Retention and your rights</h2>
      <p>We keep support conversations only as long as needed to serve you. You may ask us at any time to access or delete your data by contacting us on the details above.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page { padding: 60px 0 80px; }
  .legal-wrap { max-width: 820px; }
  .legal-wrap h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); color: #fff; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .legal-wrap h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; color: #fff; margin: 30px 0 10px; }
  .legal-wrap p { color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.75; }
  .legal-wrap a { color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: underline; }
  .legal-updated { color: #94a3b8 !important; font-size: 0.9rem; }
</style>
